I added likely-branch hints and local loads so the common profile-resolution path falls through without reloading members. This reduces branch misprediction and redundant loads in the hot decode path.

```cpp
FIT_UINT8 Field::GetType() const
{
    if (__builtin_expect(type != FIT_UINT8_INVALID, 0))
        return type;

    const Profile* p = profile;
    if (__builtin_expect(p == NULL, 0))
        return FIT_UINT8_INVALID;

    const auto idx = profileIndex;
    if (__builtin_expect(idx >= p->numFields, 0))
        return FIT_UINT8_INVALID;

    return p->fields[idx].type;
}
```